    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">Determine the strength of a password.<br><br>A password gains 1 point for each rule it satisfies:<br><br>&bull; Length is at least <const>12</const> characters.<br>&bull; Contains at least one lowercase letter.<br>&bull; Contains at least one uppercase letter.<br>&bull; Contains at least one digit.<br>&bull; Contains at least one non-alphanumerical character.<br>&bull; Does not contain any of these common passwords (case-insensitive): <const>password</const>, <const>admin</const>, <const>azerty</const>, <const>qwerty</const>, <const>1234</const>.<br><br>The result is:<br><br>&bull; <const>WEAK</const> if the score is between 0 and 3.<br>&bull; <const>MEDIUM</const> if the score is 4 or 5.<br>&bull; <const>STRONG</const> if the score is 6.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> A string <var>password</var>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> <const>WEAK</const>, <const>MEDIUM</const> or <const>STRONG</const>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\">1 &le; length of <var>password</var> &le; 100</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">password</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">WEAK</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
